[{"id":"linux-a8-dns-tools","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["DNS","dig"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>dig、host 和 nslookup 如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>dig 适合详细记录与调试，host 适合快速查询，nslookup 主要用于兼容性排查。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>记录查询类型、服务器、TTL 和响应状态；应用可能使用缓存、DoH 或自带解析器。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-object-is-eq","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","对象模型","is","相等性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(三)对象、变量与运算.md","articleTitle":"Python(三)对象、变量与运算","articlePath":"posts/76bec403/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>is\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>==\u003c/code> 的区别是什么？什么时候应该写 \u003ccode>is None\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>==\u003c/code> 比较值，\u003ccode>is\u003c/code> 比较是否为同一对象；缺失值判断应写 \u003ccode>value is None\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>列表、字符串和自定义对象可以值相等却不是同一对象。短字符串、小整数或常量复用属于实现优化，不能作为业务逻辑依据。\u003ccode>None\u003c/code> 是语言提供的单例，所以身份判断既清楚又可靠。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-container-copy","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","浅拷贝","深拷贝","共享引用"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(四)内置类型与容器.md","articleTitle":"Python(四)内置类型与容器","articlePath":"posts/c43fdd4/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>浅拷贝和深拷贝的差别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>浅拷贝只新建外层容器，内层对象继续共享；深拷贝递归复制可复制的内部对象。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>list.copy()\u003c/code>、切片和 \u003ccode>dict.copy()\u003c/code> 都是浅拷贝。嵌套可变对象是否共享要通过身份或修改实验验证；深拷贝也有成本，并不等于总是更安全。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]